  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a warm and cozy winter retreat with the Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed design of realistic cardinals perched on branches among roses, this soft and lightweight quilt set adds a perfect touch of festive holiday spirit or everyday natural beauty to any guest room, kid's room, or master suite.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt by adding your name or special custom text for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes one beautiful lightweight quilt, with optional matching pillowcases (2 or 4 pieces) to complete your bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comforting Materials:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose the perfect fit for your bed, available in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care &amp; Maintenance:</strong> Extremely simple to clean; machine wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. It dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Excellent as an indoor bed quilt, couch throw blanket, or for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Floral with Animal theme</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
